 "description": "Spends 2 credits, unless this workspace pulled the same property in the last 7 days, then free. Returns the full record for one property from a national search: owners of record, building and lot, value and equity, open mortgages and lenders, foreclosure filings and last sale. Take property_id (it starts with \"prop_\") from run_national_property_search or run_active_investor_search. Tell the user it costs 2 credits and get their go-ahead before calling. For NYC preforeclosures use get_nyc_preforeclosure_detail instead.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "properties": {
   "property_id": {
    "description": "A property id from a national search result, e.g. prop_123456.",
    "maxLength": 80,
    "minLength": 1,
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "property_id"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
